sequenceDiagram

actor DomainBuilder
participant Libxc as xc_domain_set_memory_claims
participant Domctl as XEN_DOMCTL_set_memory_claims
participant Alloc as domain_set_claims

DomainBuilder->>Libxc: claims
Libxc->>Domctl: do_domctl

Domctl->>Domctl: copy and validate claim entries
Domctl->>Alloc: validate and install claims
Alloc-->>Domctl: result
Domctl-->>Libxc: rc
Libxc-->>DomainBuilder: result
